    <li><b>Pinch</b> or <b>scroll</b>: zoom from years down to a single day</li>
    <li><b>Tap</b> a nebula or a star to dive into it</li>
    <li><b>+</b> at the bottom: write · <b>◎</b> on the right: back to today</li>
